Run migrations from the `signal-mvp` project directory after configuring `.env`
and activating its virtual environment:

```shell
alembic upgrade head
```

The migration at `f13d9a2c6b80` also seeds the bundled synthetic canonical
dataset. It includes 333 patients (332 Synthea records and one SIGNAL demo
record), plus their canonical encounters, conditions, observations, lab
results, synthetic documents, candidates, and cases. The insert is safe to
reapply and does not replace existing rows. The user-uploaded document is not
included.
